# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile.api is the repository root, because the
# FastAPI service imports sibling modules from customizations/components/tianxuan.
#
# BuildKit automatically applies this file to deploy/Dockerfile.api (the
# "<Dockerfile-name>.dockerignore" convention next to the Dockerfile). Docker's
# legacy builder ignores it; the build then still works, it is only slower.
#
# Keep only what the API image copies, so the huge game/editor tree does not get
# sent to the builder on every build.

.git
.github
apps
archive
core
data-collection
design-docs
distribution
doc
drivers
editor
engine_next
framework
gonggong-diting-data
integrations
Markdown
misc
modules
olympus-hermes-data
platform
project
releases
samples
scene
servers
tests
thirdparty
tools

# Other customization components/platforms are not imported by the API.
customizations/components/codex-dispatch
customizations/components/godot-host
customizations/components/issue-workorders
customizations/components/repository-dispatch
customizations/components/yanluo
customizations/platforms

# Generated Python artifacts.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.venv
**/venv
